 "label_rule": "Authors' week-3 calls, per nuclease. Positive: interaction == 'synthetic_lethal' (Cas12a: padj<0.1 in each of 3 replicates, dLFC<-0.3, plus saturation and week1->3 trend filters; Cas9: pooled padj<0.005, dLFC<-0.3, same filters). Negative: 'neutral', |dLFC| < that screen's median |dLFC| and padj > 0.1. Otherwise null. Only the Cas12a arm is labelled (LABELLED_ARMS); Cas9 rows are measurements with label null because Cas9 fails both gates (see verdict). Re-scoring from counts with additive GI and z<=-3 was rejected: 166-252 hits dominated by 6 essential SLCs, fitness-only AUROC 0.90-0.92, Cas12a hits recovered by Cas9 at 0.52.",
